; CHECK-31: the publishability guard scans the source tree (located through dune's
; DUNE_SOURCEROOT, whatever --build-dir is) against the data directory's denylist.txt and
; sources.toml. A set LIBRARY_INDEX_DATA without them fails; "skipped: no data dir" only
; when it is unset and the default data directory does not exist.

(test
 (name test_guard)
 (modules test_guard)
 (libraries library_index unix)
